#: scenario3:scenario3_74FEB0BA_DF3D_4B4B_9CF3_6D6C99B316E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c608a8e53dac71c5d7e7597da1aca017848a6438453569252bfc5f2e33986fbc
