msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what you get for putting it all in my hands.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For thinking I’m the only one "
"on your side!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est c’que tu récoltes en m’mettant tout sur le dos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫En pensant qu’j’suis la seule "
"de ton côté !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bde78042513a466db497bd3366baa8cba46fffe2460ad9d9341f5a878371db04
